### Cinema Management System - User Booking Flow Test
### Complete flow: Register → Login → Browse → Book → Payment → Confirm
### Uses new authentication system with USR_ token prefix

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000

### ========================================
### 1. USER REGISTRATION & LOGIN
### ========================================

### 1.1 Register New User
POST {{baseUrl}}/user/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "customer@test.com",
  "password": "customer123",
  "nama_pelanggan": "Customer Test"
}

### Response will contain USR_ prefixed token
### Copy the token from response and paste below
@userToken = USR_eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9...

### 1.2 User Login (if already registered)
POST {{baseUrl}}/user/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "customer@test.com",
  "password": "customer123"
}

### 1.3 Get User Profile
GET {{baseUrl}}/user/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### ========================================
### 2. BROWSE AVAILABLE CONTENT
### ========================================

### 2.1 Get All Films
GET {{baseUrl}}/films

### 2.2 Get Film Details (replace :id with actual film ID)
GET {{baseUrl}}/films/1

### 2.3 Get All Cabang (Branches)
GET {{baseUrl}}/cabang

### 2.4 Get All Jadwal (Schedules)
### This will show available schedules with prices
GET {{baseUrl}}/jadwal

### 2.5 Get Jadwal by Film ID (filter by film)
GET {{baseUrl}}/jadwal?id_film=1

### 2.6 Get Specific Jadwal Details
GET {{baseUrl}}/jadwal/1

### 2.7 Get Available Seats for Studio
### Replace :id_studio with actual studio ID from jadwal
GET {{baseUrl}}/kursi/studio/1

### ========================================
### 3. CREATE ORDER (BOOK TICKETS)
### ========================================

### 3.1 Create Order with Single Ticket
POST {{baseUrl}}/payment/order
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tickets": [
    {
      "id_jadwal": 1,
      "id_kursi": 1
    }
  ]
}

### Save order ID from response
@orderId = 1

### 3.2 Create Order with Multiple Tickets
POST {{baseUrl}}/payment/order
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tickets": [
    {
      "id_jadwal": 1,
      "id_kursi": 2
    },
    {
      "id_jadwal": 1,
      "id_kursi": 3
    },
    {
      "id_jadwal": 1,
      "id_kursi": 4
    }
  ]
}

### 3.3 Get Order Summary
GET {{baseUrl}}/payment/order/{{orderId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### ========================================
### 4. PROCESS PAYMENT
### ========================================

### 4.1 Get Available Payment Methods
GET {{baseUrl}}/metode-pembayaran

### 4.2 Process Payment with Virtual Account (BCA)
POST {{baseUrl}}/payment/process
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id_order": {{orderId}},
  "id_metode_pembayaran": 1
}

### 4.3 Process Payment with E-Wallet (GoPay)
POST {{baseUrl}}/payment/process
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id_order": {{orderId}},
  "id_metode_pembayaran": 3
}

### 4.4 Get Payment Info
GET {{baseUrl}}/payment/info/{{orderId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### ========================================
### 5. CONFIRM PAYMENT
### ========================================

### 5.1 Confirm Payment (User clicks "Saya Sudah Bayar")
POST {{baseUrl}}/payment/confirm/{{orderId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### ========================================
### 6. VIEW TICKETS & ORDERS
### ========================================

### 6.1 Get All User Orders
GET {{baseUrl}}/tickets/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### 6.2 Get All User Tickets
GET {{baseUrl}}/tickets
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### 6.3 Get Specific Ticket Details
GET {{baseUrl}}/tickets/1
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### 6.4 Get Ticket Status
GET {{baseUrl}}/tickets/1/status
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### ========================================
### 7. CANCEL ORDER (OPTIONAL)
### ========================================

### 7.1 Cancel Order (before payment confirmation)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/payment/order/{{orderId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### ========================================
### 8. ERROR SCENARIOS
### ========================================

### 8.1 Book Already Booked Seat (should fail)
POST {{baseUrl}}/payment/order
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tickets": [
    {
      "id_jadwal": 1,
      "id_kursi": 1
    }
  ]
}

### 8.2 Book Past Schedule (should fail)
POST {{baseUrl}}/payment/order
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tickets": [
    {
      "id_jadwal": 999,
      "id_kursi": 1
    }
  ]
}

### 8.3 Book Non-existent Seat (should fail)
POST {{baseUrl}}/payment/order
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tickets": [
    {
      "id_jadwal": 1,
      "id_kursi": 99999
    }
  ]
}

### 8.4 Access Without Token (should fail - 401)
GET {{baseUrl}}/user/profile

### 8.5 Access with Admin Token (should fail - 403)
### First get admin token
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@cinema.com",
  "password": "admin123"
}

@adminToken = ADM_eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9...

### Try to create order with admin token (should fail)
POST {{baseUrl}}/payment/order
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tickets": [
    {
      "id_jadwal": 1,
      "id_kursi": 5
    }
  ]
}

### 8.6 Confirm Already Confirmed Payment (should fail)
POST {{baseUrl}}/payment/confirm/{{orderId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### 8.7 Process Payment for Expired Order (should fail)
### Wait 15+ minutes after creating order, then try to process payment
POST {{baseUrl}}/payment/process
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id_order": {{orderId}},
  "id_metode_pembayaran": 1
}

### ========================================
### 9. COMPLETE BOOKING FLOW EXAMPLE
### ========================================

### Step 1: Register/Login User
POST {{baseUrl}}/user/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "newuser@test.com",
  "password": "user123",
  "nama_pelanggan": "New User"
}

### Step 2: Browse Films
GET {{baseUrl}}/films

### Step 3: Check Schedules for Film
GET {{baseUrl}}/jadwal?id_film=1

### Step 4: Check Available Seats
GET {{baseUrl}}/kursi/studio/1

### Step 5: Create Order
POST {{baseUrl}}/payment/order
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tickets": [
    {
      "id_jadwal": 1,
      "id_kursi": 10
    },
    {
      "id_jadwal": 1,
      "id_kursi": 11
    }
  ]
}

### Step 6: Get Payment Methods
GET {{baseUrl}}/metode-pembayaran

### Step 7: Process Payment
POST {{baseUrl}}/payment/process
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id_order": 1,
  "id_metode_pembayaran": 1
}

### Step 8: Get Payment Info (VA/QR Code)
GET {{baseUrl}}/payment/info/1
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### Step 9: Confirm Payment
POST {{baseUrl}}/payment/confirm/1
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### Step 10: View Tickets
GET {{baseUrl}}/tickets/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### ========================================
### NOTES:
### ========================================
### - User token has USR_ prefix and expires in 7 days
### - Order expires in 15 minutes if not paid
### - Seat status: TERSEDIA → DIPESAN (after order) → TERJUAL (after payment)
### - Ticket status: PENDING → CONFIRMED (after payment)
### - Order status: PENDING → PAID (after confirmation)
### - Payment status: PENDING → SUCCESS (after confirmation)
### - Cannot book past schedules (validated by backend)
### - Cannot book already booked/sold seats
### - Price is calculated automatically based on:
###   tanggal → tipe hari → aturan harga (cabang + tipe studio + tipe hari)
### - User cannot manipulate price (no id_tipe_hari in request)
### - Admin token (ADM_) cannot access user endpoints
### - User token (USR_) cannot access admin endpoints
